15
00:02:23,170 --> 00:02:27,670
But I used a <i>bit</i> too much force, and...

16
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:32,340
He was like, "What is this, 
Fist of the N Star?"

17
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:33,890
Why'd you have to stab him?

18
00:02:34,220 --> 00:02:37,780
I mean, his body shape's 
nothing like when we were kids,

19
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,980
and seeing him up close, well...

20
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:44,190
