21
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,190
After he's grown way taller than her

22
00:02:44,190 --> 00:02:47,560
I don't think I can pull it off.

23
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:50,110
I can't get us beyond 
just childhood friends.

24
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:55,620
I was hoping Kakeru would notice me,
even just a little, but...

25
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:02,960
It's too soon to give up!

26
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:05,510
And you call yourself 
the Blood-Soaked Lily?

27
00:03:05,510 --> 00:03:08,880
Th-That's not a nickname 
I'm particularly proud of.

28
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:11,040
I'll teach you some more.

29
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:13,140
We'll show him!

30
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:15,830
That's convincing coming from people

31
00:03:15,830 --> 00:03:18,150
who went from childhood
 friends to being in love.

32
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:19,250
Huh?

33
00:03:19,250 --> 00:03:23,760
We aren't exactly in love with each other.

34
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,780
Wha?

35
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,020
That's clearly not true.

36
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:28,030
You're mutually in love.

37
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:33,360
I-It's true that I have... er...

38
00:03:29,990 --> 00:03:31,950
Mumble,
mumble

39
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:36,580
On the other hand, 
I don't know how he feels.

40
00:03:36,580 --> 00:03:40,550
Which is why I'm playing the game 
to try to get him to say I'm cute.

41
00:03:40,550 --> 00:03:42,210
But he just won't...

42
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:48,100
Oh, <i>please</i> don't tell Yukiya about this.

43
00:03:50,090 --> 00:03:51,880
Thank you, Sakura-san.

44
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,570
I'm counting on you.

45
00:03:54,570 --> 00:03:57,390
Yup! Let's make it happen!

46
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,630
Okay, thank you in advance, master!

47
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,700
M-Maybe don't call me master.

48
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:06,050
First, you play Kakeru.

49
00:04:06,050 --> 00:04:08,190
I'll try retaliating.

50
00:04:08,190 --> 00:04:10,310
Wait, wait, wait...

51
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:12,820
Man, it's hot.

52
00:04:20,910 --> 00:04:22,440
What's wrong, Kazane?

53
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,040
You're beet red.

54
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:27,670
Did I happen to get your heart racing?

55
00:04:28,670 --> 00:04:29,770
Come on, Senpai.

56
00:04:29,770 --> 00:04:31,710
You can't just sit there blushing.

57
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:33,620
In these situations...

58
00:04:36,050 --> 00:04:38,930
<i>You're</i> the one stricken by me.

59
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:46,820
Debauchery!

60
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:55,240
<i>In that moment, her life 
flashed before her eyes.</i>

61
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,710
Miku-chan.

62
00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:02,670
Grandma's calling my name.

63
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:04,930
I'm sorry!

64
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:11,200
Sakura-san, what's going through your 
mind when you do this kind of thing?

65
00:05:11,670 --> 00:05:14,430
What's going th-th-through my mind?

66
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:19,760
I'm just hoping to tease Yukiya for 
being overwhelmed by my cuteness.

67
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,510
I see...

68
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:25,840
So you like seeing Asagi-kun 
flustered and in a panic.

69
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,640
N-No!

70
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:30,160
I mean, well,

71
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:34,260
when he tries to retaliate even 
though he doesn't have it in him,

72
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:37,570
that's kind of cute.

73
00:05:37,570 --> 00:05:41,810
But considering that your act was 
more like Asagi-kun than Kakeru,

74
00:05:41,810 --> 00:05:44,540
and considering that was the first 
thing that came to your mind...

75
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:48,050
Sakura-san, is that the kind of 
thing that gets you turned on?

76
00:05:48,670 --> 00:05:50,980
Perhaps you have some slightly 
masochistic proclivities?

77
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,300
Lewd!

78
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:03,710
Why won't you give a straight answer?!

79
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:05,600
It isn't lewd!

80
00:06:06,650 --> 00:06:09,390
Later! See you tomorrow.

81
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,000
'Sup!

82
00:06:18,150 --> 00:06:21,320
Kakeru Chigusa
Kazane's Childhood Friend
Student Council General Admin

83
00:06:18,150 --> 00:06:23,580
A few minutes ago

84
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,840
I gotta be somewhere real quick. 
I'll leave my bag here.

85
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,690
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

86
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,990
<i>As soon as Kakeru gets back,</i>

87
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,460
<i>I'm going to do what 
Sakura-san did, and...</i>

88
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:33,790
Hey, Kazane, I'm home.

89
00:06:34,710 --> 00:06:36,300
<i>"I-I'm home"?!</i>

90
00:06:36,730 --> 00:06:38,560
<i>Does he think this is his place?</i>

91
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,540
<i>Our home?</i>

92
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:42,380
<i>That would make us a married couple!</i>

93
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:43,150
Hey, I'm home.

94
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:45,260
I bought some
toilet paper
on the way back.

95
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:45,260
Hey, I'm home.

96
00:06:43,150 --> 00:06:45,260
I bought some toilet paper 
on the way back.

97
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,390
Are you all right?

98
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:48,680
