Oh, right, never mind that.

105
00:07:18,390 --> 00:07:19,500
Kazane.

106
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,260
Huh? What?

107
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:22,510
Athletic tape?

108
00:07:22,510 --> 00:07:24,340
I got some from the nurse's office.

109
00:07:24,650 --> 00:07:28,220
You sprained your finger when you 
jabbed my stomach yesterday, didn't you?

110
00:07:29,790 --> 00:07:32,100
I'm surprised you noticed.

111
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:33,710
Of course I would.

112
00:07:34,210 --> 00:07:37,160
It's not a big deal. Relax.

113
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,120
You shouldn't underestimate injury.

114
00:07:42,350 --> 00:07:43,570
Hey...

115
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:58,030
Um...

116
00:08:01,530 --> 00:08:03,690
That's enough.

117
00:08:04,010 --> 00:08:05,590
Thanks.

118
00:08:05,590 --> 00:08:06,940
Sure.

119
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:08,330
No prob.

120
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:14,850
Café

121
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:14,850
Café

122
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:14,240
Did the student council 
president figure it out?

123
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:17,020
Yeah, I'm sure she'll be fine.

124
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:18,900
She's doing her best.

125
00:08:19,230 --> 00:08:23,060
<i>I never thought my Love Game experience 
would be useful for anyone else.</i>

126
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:24,780
<i>What a weird feeling.</i>

127
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,810
Yukiya.

128
00:08:27,490 --> 00:08:28,760
Draw me a heart.

129
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,490
What? Why?

130
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:33,640
Are you embarrassed?

131
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:36,330
Catching feelings, maybe?

132
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,620
Write "you're lovely."

133
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:41,510
Even more demands.

134
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,010
<i>Here we go.</i>

135
00:08:46,010 --> 00:08:47,140
<i>Here we go!</i>

136
00:08:46,010 --> 00:08:48,180
Lo

137
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:55,690
Loser

138
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:59,940
Look at you, getting so 
worked up over omurice.

139
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:01,940
What a loser.

140
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:07,900
<i>Yukiya isn't supposed to 
be so good at this!</i>

141
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:10,520
<i>I'm going to make him say I'm cute!</i>

142
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:16,040
I Want to End This Love Game

143
