Toridenami Bookstore

144
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:22,270
Such a beautiful mindset.

145
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,880
I should try not to forget it.

146
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:26,300
Things are going well with Yukiya lately.

147
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:30,080
I should refine my cuteness 
even more to teach him a lesson.

148
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:36,460
But I can't be cute like someone else.

149
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:42,420
I have to be special.

150
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,820
Da-ding!

151
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:48,500
Quiz for the lonely loner 
sitting all by his lonesome.

152
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:50,960
Get it right and you'll get a snack.

153
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:56,250
What's a cute little squid 
that goes well with sumiso?

154
00:09:56,250 --> 00:10:00,080
The firefly squid!

155
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:04,670
What's the king of squids?

156
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:04,670
Group Assignment - Group 1

157
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:08,420
Bigfin reef squids?

158
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,250
They don't really come 
across kingly, though.

159
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:13,110
The humidity's killing my hair. I hate this.

160
00:10:13,110 --> 00:10:14,370
Oh, they're back.

161
00:10:14,370 --> 00:10:15,770
Here you go.

162
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:17,850
Black Bolt

163
00:10:17,850 --> 00:10:19,530
<i>I can have it?</i>

164
00:10:19,530 --> 00:10:20,980
<i>So what </i>is<i> the answer?</i>

165
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,720
Kanegon says he was no good.

166
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,610
That guy you were talking about?

167
00:10:24,610 --> 00:10:26,470
He's too much of a kid.

168
00:10:26,470 --> 00:10:28,560
He laughs his ass off over dirty jokes.

169
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:31,540
Cringe. He was hot, though.

170
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:33,940
Gon's so picky when it comes to guys.

171
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:37,080
Miku, do you know anyone?

172
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:42,710
<i>Don't try to rope Miku into this nonsense!</i>

173
00:10:49,470 --> 00:10:51,820
<i>Crap, I reacted by accident!</i>

174
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,470
Oh, right.

175
00:10:54,470 --> 00:10:58,760
Hey, Asagi-kun, you said you like 
that Cosmo Connect anime, right?

176
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,770
Urp!

177
00:10:59,770 --> 00:11:01,360
Hm? What?

178
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:04,940
They made this as part of a 
make-up collab with Cosmo Connect.

179
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:07,360
They did, huh?

180
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,430
I'll put you in full bloom!

181
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,990
“Cosmo Connect”                          Special Moves Compilation
200,000 views              1 month ago            #cosmoconnect

182
00:11:09,990 --> 00:11:15,570
I don't know much about it, 
but it's a cute color, so I bought it.

183
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:16,660
Wanna see?

184
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:20,930
Oh, th-that's the Aitaso color.

185
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:23,130
Er, yeah, they did a good job with that.

186
00:11:23,130 --> 00:11:26,770
It represents the character's 
traits well. Super-high quality.

187
00:11:26,770 --> 00:11:29,330
I noticed more women have been 
playing social media games lately

188
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:31,680
and there's some cute merch out there.

189
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,550
Seeing it in person warms my heart.

190
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:35,150
I can tell the creators 
poured their soul into it.

191
00:11:36,370 --> 00:11:38,690
You went <i>off</i>!

192
00:11:38,690 --> 00:11:41,250
What, is she your favorite?

193
00:11:41,250 --> 00:11:42,690
So funny!

194
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:46,660
<i>Akane finally understands 
the amusement that is Yukiya.</i>

195
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:48,150
<i>Yukiya's hilarious.</i>

196
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:49,890
I just tried it on.

197
00:11:49,890 --> 00:11:50,740
Look.

198
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:52,430
It's cute, right?

199
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:53,160
Uh...

200
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:57,920
<i>My life would be so much easier 
if he never struggled to say yes to that.</i>

201
00:11:57,920 --> 00:12:00,480
Yup. It's super cute.

202
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:09,800
Is it a bit glittery?

203
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:13,360
Yeah! Can you tell? It has lamé in it.

204
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,750
Pretty!

205
00:12:14,750 --> 00:12:18,820
Yeah, it makes you think of 
Aitaso's special attack.

206
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,310
Wow, you're hella studious.

207
00:12:24,350 --> 00:12:26,700
You're doing the group 
assignment by yourself?

208
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:28,110
No, well...

209
00:12:28,110 --> 00:12:30,280
I didn't have any good 
comments during class,

210
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:32,460
so I wanted to at least 
write the summary.

211
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:33,860
Group Assignment - Group 1

212
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:33,860
So I sent them home.

213
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:37,640
<i>It's easier working on my own 
than in a group anyway.</i>

214
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:39,700
Wow. You're amazing.

215
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:41,550
She gave out a compliment.

216
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:42,660
That never happens.

217
00:12:44,290 --> 00:12:47,620
Oh yeah, wanna add 
each other on Instantgram?

218
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:51,460
Th-This kid's so weird.

219
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:55,070
He's too stuck up to install the app. 
Says it's too trashy.

220
00:12:55,070 --> 00:12:56,420
I could never get him to.

221
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:57,930
Actually?

222
00:12:57,930 --> 00:13:02,160
So you're one of those 
no-social-media guys, huh?

223
00:13:02,890 --> 00:13:07,850
W-Want me to be an in-between 
if you want to get in touch with Yukiya?

224
00:13:12,490 --> 00:13:17,630
I'm not about to steal 
your hubby, Miku. Relax.

225
00:13:18,810 --> 00:13:20,740
You're so desperate.

226
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:23,680
I never said anything like that!

227
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,580
Right, Nacchan?

228
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:29,200
Mochi!

229
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,710
Say what?!

230
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:36,510
I-I'm gonna go buy a drink.

231
00:13:37,430 --> 00:13:40,390
Miku's adorable when she's like that.

232
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:49,440
I blew it!

233
00:13:52,650 --> 00:13:54,380
Grandma...

234
00:13:52,650 --> 00:13:54,820
Miku

235
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:59,570
That's not the kind of 
cute I'm going for.

236
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,270
Sakura-san.

237
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,740
There you are.

238
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:05,500
You scared me!

239
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:07,420
What is it, Senpai?

240
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:09,620
There's something 
I want to talk to you about.

241
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:12,990
Last night, I did some searching online

242
00:14:12,990 --> 00:14:16,860
to figure out how 
I might get back at Kakeru.

243
00:14:16,860 --> 00:14:22,050
And I discovered 
a devastatingly radical game.

244
00:14:22,050 --> 00:14:24,220
Huh? What's that?

245
00:14:24,220 --> 00:14:25,370
This.

246
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:30,420
I'm told it's called the Pokitto game.

247
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:34,690
The game where you each bite 
one side and eat toward the middle.

248
00:14:34,690 --> 00:14:38,200
<i>Senpai doesn't know the Pokitto game?</i>

249
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,000
<i>No way.</i>

250
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:42,600
Such a game must not 
be allowed to spread.

251
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,200
It may need to be banned.

252
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:46,910
Huh? Why shouldn't it be allowed?

253
00:14:46,910 --> 00:14:48,010
What do you mean, what?

254
00:14:48,010 --> 00:14:52,130
You do it knowing that your lips 
will come close to meeting.

255
00:14:52,130 --> 00:14:56,590
There has to be some 
expectation that you will kiss.

256
00:14:56,590 --> 00:14:59,760
The thrill of it becomes tempting

257
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:04,830
and must be an ulterior motive.

258
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:07,490
Absolutely despicable!

259
00:15:07,490 --> 00:15:08,850
<i>Now that she mentions it...</i>

260
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:14,280
